    {
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/consumables/potions/red-dragons-breath-potion.webp",
      "name": "Red Dragon's Breath Potion (Young)",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>This liquid contains blood from a red dragon. For 1 hour after you imbibe the concoction, you can unleash a red dragon's breath weapon. The potency of the breath depends on the potion's type, based on the age of the dragon whose blood was used to make the potion.</p>\n<p>Exhaling dragon breath uses a single action. You create a @Template[cone|distance:15] of fire which deals @Damage[4d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage. All creatures in the area must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:23|basic|name:Young Red Dragon's Breath Potion|options:area-effect] save.</p>\n<p>After you use the breath weapon, you can't do so again for [[/r 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
        },
